{"id": "clm:142ba0937f54e4de3be2169e476296fe0554f12673f1354b88d594bfcc78b525", "type": "statement", "text": "Paper preparation affects registration: Canon recommends factory mill-cut digital-compatible paper for consistency, while Xerox identifies paper expansion/contraction, inaccurate cutting and storage conditions as possible causes of misalignment or skew. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://downloads.canon.com/bicg2022/ced/svc-imagepress-v900-series-ced-rev2.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://download.support.xerox.com/pub/docs/XRIP_V180_EX/userdocs/any-os/en_GB/EN_SystemAdministrationGuide_Versant180Press_v1.0.pdf"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6fc5bbb39492dbba7bf1b58f0317cfca2b337f8e16aa01cc618fc129360d81d7", "ev:a18f928ae9b0bc7dc9256d70257ffde3ff81874ae8b2144b6c2893a19d5847db"]}
{"id": "clm:5acaf6db4138a2692955912ad89b7d29bfb187ace2a911ad0fedb33c99913697", "type": "statement", "text": "Canon warns that curl can cause diagonal feeding and that heavy paper may feed poorly even without curl. Its grain recommendations also depend on sheet size. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://oip.manual.canon/USRMA-7565-zz-PS-900-enUS/contents/devu-beginning-dev_spec-papers.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:a9d84ccc06597b37904251cba1e337eca4ec75c7bf109d7ccf0fc223739130a7"]}
{"id": "clm:a6624aecae3ffa4d527cfee7616eb5a4a193a2ace69e3976d98f85703fa0600f", "type": "statement", "text": "Canon’s customer expectations document warns that customer-cut sheets can cause feeding and registration errors. It recommends clean cuts and factory mill-cut, digital-compatible paper for consistent front-back registration. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://downloads.canon.com/bicg2022/ced/svc-imagepress-v900-series-ced-rev2.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:87dedcf6200d4550af9551e394fc166b3753165c6b7943ad45f7adf246903ac0"]}
{"id": "clm:8129f0c908440937b44e56d9f87be11f164a7d435ede3970a492d5e6a9873c2b", "type": "statement", "text": "The V900 Series US customer-expectations table limits engine drawers to uncoated 52–300 g/m2; its optional POD Deck Lite-C1 supports uncoated 52–350 and coated 85–350 g/m2. Feed-location limits therefore qualify the headline stock weight. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://downloads.canon.com/bicg2022/ced/svc-imagepress-v900-series-ced-rev2.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "measures", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b0eed9adf788f80d31963f8603583454a8c9b751c7fd11b93bfefbd87ca6be92"]}
{"id": "clm:42eec700727a70d66650d579a964acabb077dcccb9424bef8ad0df35a8ad231e", "type": "statement", "text": "Canon specifies separation rollers with air assist for the POD Deck Lite XL-A2, with a 350 g/m2 maximum for non-long sheets but 300 g/m2 for long sheets. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://downloads.canon.com/bicg2022/ced/svc-imagepress-v900-series-ced-rev2.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "measures", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:c4217cedda0318613847387475a4193e2de49e179bc2da8f78b8539e06730314"]}
{"id": "clm:80ed61ef123f81b5f31e92d55abd593172b8fcfd84f30dcafc12a6556fe62f92", "type": "statement", "text": "Ricoh advertises 40–470 gsm media handling for the Pro C7500, and separately advertises built-in front-to-back registration and automatic duplexing up to 13 × 38 inches. This page does not establish that every stock at the maximum weight can duplex at the maximum size. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.ricoh-usa.com/en/production-printing/products/pd/sheet-fed/pro-c7500-color-sheet-fed-printer", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "measures", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:8d2d6c34d6e502019164a5f97eb57559c7c7d5c25b767f77e2929f7003cb9734", "ev:c02e044a5cfc3d3f005312c6256c074653166f9a6acfb30b64cad71a3465b912"]}
{"id": "clm:bc93530b4a3876fe2490735118c7f9f0ba6944ecb1da7dc1d7251c02a9ead437", "type": "statement", "text": "Canon’s V900-series troubleshooting FAQ says misalignment below 1.0 mm may not be correctable. It explains that reversing the sheet makes the back print start from the opposite physical edge; this warning is not a measured repeatability distribution. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://oip.manual.canon/FAQ01-0607-zz-PS_x2-enGB/contents/PS900-mcn_set_ajst-fix_misalignmentimg.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5c6e883371c6583fbb9dcc52b5a114246ba4ef5037de005ee43001ec2517df69"]}
{"id": "clm:57e0e1108c1d39a13e7b94e91d8eaad3899584818493f6b4caa092b94dc10f78", "type": "statement", "text": "Ricoh advertises Pro C7500 automatic duplexing up to 13 × 38 inches, but its S14 banner-tray table limits sheets longer than 19.2 inches to 300 gsm. The 470 gsm headline cannot be combined with maximum banner length as an unrestricted capability. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://assets.ricoh-usa.com/j2jqn9lauv41/4iS14kTGz7Yg4dXMTmtJVQ/e7f6b9516c8d5febbdb6eaa3f41a0940/Pro_C7500_Brochure.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0a83d30c1ae8d178adc07c701a58921c8a850123e275ca8dfd61ba144ac168e9", "ev:330a9c996552aee57f4cfbeeaa34fc3dc58f69240bb03451411beb4d6aa31bc5"]}
{"id": "clm:9645664d1e32128f282605c831715ed6d801012082681e26201979d7bce83f5c", "type": "statement", "text": "Ricoh’s brochure contains conflicting tray ratings: its main table lists 40–470 gsm for Trays 3–8, whereas the RT5150 table limits Trays 5–8 to 40–400 gsm. These are attributed document positions; the installed configuration’s actual limit remains unresolved. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://assets.ricoh-usa.com/j2jqn9lauv41/4iS14kTGz7Yg4dXMTmtJVQ/e7f6b9516c8d5febbdb6eaa3f41a0940/Pro_C7500_Brochure.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:05a9f0242c90019989cc22506b8cb8cc17c9520709fe132f042e7f09859e92e6", "ev:34e35b7755db9dac1354f0428dd4ae75e447edd653f773509eb0279126c9815e"]}
{"id": "clm:cf30b310e2cfd8e5ff607a985b54390f95b2f23475847f8abea6193f74626549", "type": "statement", "text": "Air-assisted sheet separation is documented in both Xerox tray controls and Canon’s optional POD Deck Lite-C1. These are manufacturer feature descriptions, rather than independently measured feeding reliability. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://download.support.xerox.com/pub/docs/VERSANT_4100/userdocs/any-os/en_GB/Xerox_Versant4100Press_user_doc_en-us.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://downloads.canon.com/bicg2022/ced/svc-imagepress-v900-series-ced-rev2.pdf"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:833960a865b5e0f624105e7a80fd2f61c7f250a70a212667472fac28ee679e68", "ev:cae5537bbb488979d9ea11ac17cc99f2a163655e0b02c726935b9395e4ef9f95"]}
{"id": "clm:9c19b5f74047a76a2f002799b539f06598a58e38b7a05cd23c571a97e2c16ce3", "type": "statement", "text": "Canon advertises automatic duplex printing up to 350 gsm for the imagePRESS V900 Series; this is a manufacturer capability claim, not a measured card-production result. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://sg.canon/en/business/imagepress-v900-series/main/product", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:c43708925b5d946d6db4071415140a6ac6dfc9b419457de277f40fd34f712cc8"]}
{"id": "clm:619468f30eaf89b1985caa5b15ce8acc02b08980ea28a1cb52a602d2a6035a41", "type": "statement", "text": "Canon says its optional Sensing Unit-B1 monitors and adjusts front-to-back registration before and during production, including adjustments during printing. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://downloads.canon.com/bicg2022/ced/svc-imagepress-v900-series-ced-rev2.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:15a143b6a8d3535426c3049650a4fb1aee8e9ee004bb8a39c94cb5f195cbe7fb", "ev:831a871da93888de54e2a59d33a29603a827225c223f20633acfce6025ede11a"]}
{"id": "clm:0d76c71691311b492c46f00df3bd25501672aa3e392a3264ba5a6463cf9c5069", "type": "statement", "text": "Canon recommends at least 24 hours of paper acclimatization and thorough fanning before loading the V900 Series; it warns that paper from a different temperature/humidity environment may jam or print poorly. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://downloads.canon.com/bicg2022/ced/svc-imagepress-v900-series-ced-rev2.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:f3e2991b495b1e3c119fc3e5b22a0a402176b266863b9ebb73f85dad4f9b9b97"]}
{"id": "clm:d3de8d5355b8f8c5867bd921e386fb20c96bef7de3fa6e99a2275ea28e311434", "type": "statement", "text": "For the Versant 180, Xerox instructs operators to run automatic alignment before manual adjustment. Manual controls cover skew, scale, and lead/side image position, including misalignment between sides. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://download.support.xerox.com/pub/docs/XRIP_V180_EX/userdocs/any-os/en_GB/EN_SystemAdministrationGuide_Versant180Press_v1.0.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:52eab71306f4a67a9ca2f3e5ff84e498c9aaf2aad34b0f0d80aeffd7832d9a28", "ev:c6fe172c2a03d177a9bf9738866e4b9d96ab68847994e2cc7953f45ee58d3aef", "ev:f82b5dc437eddabef57aa66ff57f8509988680553f54d97f038f3d54269bb2ef"]}
{"id": "clm:a9e7ee4e5195cd88a3684f683854c138b5cfabb3b335c53e694d916c2bfaec5a", "type": "statement", "text": "The Versant 180 SIQA procedure creates alignment profiles for individual stock/tray combinations, with up to 50 profiles; Xerox says the profile is reused with its associated stock. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://download.support.xerox.com/pub/docs/XRIP_V180_EX/userdocs/any-os/en_GB/EN_SystemAdministrationGuide_Versant180Press_v1.0.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b617f26e3e827f415d3ca08d4eb3e88d191aa00c15c61348897ecbbd285f031a", "ev:f82b5dc437eddabef57aa66ff57f8509988680553f54d97f038f3d54269bb2ef"]}
{"id": "clm:9951b700e08434b7fa000df862d62907f2d098995f339778b468a1f55bde780e", "type": "statement", "text": "Versant 180 air-assist volume is adjustable for custom paper types. Its Auto setting follows paper type/weight, while its Multifeed Support Table lowers air volume. These instructions are specific to this model. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://download.support.xerox.com/pub/docs/XRIP_V180_EX/userdocs/any-os/en_GB/EN_SystemAdministrationGuide_Versant180Press_v1.0.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:631b54f5de0a97c4cfe35781e1276a4024ab2cfe1c0b68720b0db416c608ef0b", "ev:f82b5dc437eddabef57aa66ff57f8509988680553f54d97f038f3d54269bb2ef"]}
{"id": "clm:6c8e02c67e0a1d87e97bf4be3c7ef159b746b3daa6550276eb7cb394fd81c261", "type": "statement", "text": "Xerox and Canon document separate corrections for skew, image distortion, scale and edge position. Front-to-back alignment therefore requires checking image geometry as well as translation. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://download.support.xerox.com/pub/docs/VERSANT_4100/userdocs/any-os/en_GB/Xerox_Versant4100Press_user_doc_en-us.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://oip.manual.canon/USRMA-7567-zz-PS-900-enUV/contents/devu-ptype_mng-img_posi-manual.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:271502355fa0fd9b0a6ed463a422f1b18d60efe359852bd17c01c5d15eddf809", "ev:e72f917c6f125ab6dca8c0ba8488fdf6915fb17a4ab0aec09d4c65362da5c7dc"]}
{"id": "clm:cbad08e0c97c71e8e7e8d9e06366a596983d5efed0b6e1e83a1064ebb845013f", "type": "statement", "text": "Xerox recommends paper from the same lot for duplex jobs. Its manual attributes front-back variation to sheet-size differences and fusing heat and pressure stretching the sheet. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://download.support.xerox.com/pub/docs/VERSANT_4100/userdocs/any-os/en_GB/Xerox_Versant4100Press_user_doc_en-us.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:8f06f6d8a5693222c11a68ed83cf76563e6d69373b9eef6dbeaa2488b1528f9f"]}
{"id": "clm:30ad049b085e1d33d2524bf25bbe6feff00eb12e168a97c50c80cb4261d0bd57", "type": "statement", "text": "For the Versant 4100, Xerox instructs operators to run automatic alignment first, then test individual manual changes. Its manual correction order is perpendicularity, skew, magnification, then registration. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://download.support.xerox.com/pub/docs/VERSANT_4100/userdocs/any-os/en_GB/Xerox_Versant4100Press_user_doc_en-us.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:35dc783e90b4205ebd38df8f4db3ba62d90358a1844d2a63bbf3e719da5fdda1", "ev:431d7210413e65300769d1bdd2aed3bff786f2c3944ff216c28921915a207b29", "ev:e89d2e5e398b8553f66d7ddc49fc05cdf97ce65cedd38ec336650b1cab398a1a"]}
{"id": "clm:7c6b3ea58ae962e9e15fd6fa9191805b0e06a57ed14816beb840a238e15b3609", "type": "statement", "text": "The Versant 4100 manual distinguishes feed sources: the tray specifications immediately preceding Trays 6 and 7 allow 64–256 gsm, while Trays 6 and 7 allow 52–400 gsm. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://download.support.xerox.com/pub/docs/VERSANT_4100/userdocs/any-os/en_GB/Xerox_Versant4100Press_user_doc_en-us.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:431d7210413e65300769d1bdd2aed3bff786f2c3944ff216c28921915a207b29", "ev:e9ee6931da700634256a2d411021c10d23fafa7cc06e108a262a8d5addd55908"]}
{"id": "clm:26f5de5011eb79478b81a867b07f3f84395dc6655235f4354c97000a375bf69d", "type": "statement", "text": "Canon warns that paper stiffness, thickness, air permeability, smoothness and moisture absorption can prevent sufficient image quality or reliable feeding. A paper-weight rating alone does not establish compatibility with a particular card stock. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://oip.manual.canon/USRMA-7565-zz-PS-900-enUS/contents/devu-beginning-dev_spec-papers.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Duplex card printing registration and stock feeding"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:7a245d06947d959427227f14a74256f1e9620517bed2f453f65e88c104a04071", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:bbeb760e48b8301ec9c5d1fd65f194c5608f5dad37f42b25eb74356b90f13446"]}
